    "bayrum": {
      "word": "BAY RUM",
      "definitions": [
        {
          "text": "A fragrant liquid, used for cosmetic and medicinal purposes. believed, by distillation from the leaves of the bayberry (Myrcia acris). The bay rum of the Pharmacopoeia (spirit of myrcia) is prepared from oil of myrcia (bayberry), oil of orange peel, oil of pimento, alcohol, and water.",
